/: ========================================
/: RTL AOC Verification Workflow
/: ========================================
/: Post-Formalized NormCode Plan (.pf.ncd)
/:
/: GOAL: Generate AOC schemas from ISA/MA specs, then verify RTL traces
/:
/: PHASES:
/:   Phase 1: AOC Schema Generation
/:     - Load ISA and MA specification files
/:     - Get user clarification (intent blocks)
/:     - Iteratively extract AOC canonicals until done
/:     - Validate the generated AOC definitions
/:   Phase 2: RTL Trace Verification
/:     - Load RTL simulation trace
/:     - Split into discrete cycles
/:     - For each cycle: update active rules, verify trace
/:     - Produce verification report
/:
/: PARADIGM SET:
/:   File System:
/:     - h_LiteralPath-c_ReadFile-o_Literal
/:   LLM:
/:     - v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Literal
/:     - v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Boolean
/:   Python:
/:     - v_ScriptLocation-h_Literal-c_Execute-o_Literal
/:     - v_ScriptLocation-h_Literal-c_Execute-o_ListLiteral
/:

:<:{verification report} | ?{flow_index}: 1
    | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
    | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
    | %{ref_element}: dict(aoc_definitions: dict, aoc_valid: bool, trace: list, verification_per_cycle: list)
    <= ::(combine AOC definitions, validity, trace, and per-cycle verification into report) | ?{flow_index}: 1.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
        | %{norm_input}: v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Literal
        | %{v_input_norm}: prompt_location
        | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/prompts/combine_verification_report.md
        | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
        | %{body_faculty}: llm

    /: ============================================================
    /: PHASE 1: AOC Schema Generation
    /: ============================================================
    
    <- {AOC definitions} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2
        | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
        | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
        | %{ref_element}: dict(rules: list, metadata: dict)
        <= $. %>({all AOC schema}) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.1 | ?{sequence}: assigning
            /: SPECIFICATION: Select the final AOC schema as output
        
        /: ----------------------------------------
        /: Ground inputs: Load specification files
        /: ----------------------------------------
        <- {ISA spec text} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.2
            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
            | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
            | %{ref_element}: str
            <= ::(load ISA specification file) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.2.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
                | %{norm_input}: h_LiteralPath-c_ReadFile-o_Literal
                | %{h_input_norm}: LiteralPath
                | %{body_faculty}: file_system
            <- {ISA file path}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.2.1.1
                | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                | %{ref_element}: str
                | %{literal<$% file_path>}: provisions/inputs/specs/isa_v1.md
        
        <- {MA spec text} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.3
            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
            | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
            | %{ref_element}: str
            <= ::(load microarchitecture specification file) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.3.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
                | %{norm_input}: h_LiteralPath-c_ReadFile-o_Literal
                | %{h_input_norm}: LiteralPath
                | %{body_faculty}: file_system
            <- {MA file path}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.3.1.1
                | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                | %{ref_element}: str
                | %{literal<$% file_path>}: provisions/inputs/specs/uarch_v2.md
        
        /: ----------------------------------------
        /: User decomposition of specs
        /: ----------------------------------------
        <- {intent blocks} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.4
            | %{ref_axes}: [intent_block]
            | %{ref_shape}: (n_intent,)
            | %{ref_element}: dict(id: str, text: str, type: str)
            <= :>:(ask user to clarify and decompose the specs into intent blocks) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.4.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
                | %{norm_input}: v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_UserTextEditor-o_JsonLiteral
                | %{v_input_norm}: prompt_location
                | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/prompts/phase1/decompose_specs.md
                | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
                | %{body_faculty}: user_input
                | %{interaction_type}: text_editor
            <- {ISA spec text}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.4.1.1
                | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                | %{ref_element}: str
            <- {MA spec text}<:{2}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.4.1.2
                | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                | %{ref_element}: str
        
        <- {all user inputs} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.5
            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
            | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
            | %{ref_element}: dict(isa: str, ma: str, intent_blocks: list)
            <= &[{}] %>[{ISA spec text}, {MA spec text}, {intent blocks}] %+(inputs) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.5.1 | ?{sequence}: grouping
                /: GROUPING: Collect ISA, MA, and intent blocks together
            <- {ISA spec text} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.5.1.1
                | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                | %{ref_element}: str
            <- {MA spec text} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.5.1.2
                | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                | %{ref_element}: str
            <- {intent blocks} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.5.1.3
                | %{ref_axes}: [intent_block]
                | %{ref_element}: dict
        
        /: ----------------------------------------
        /: Initialize counters before loop
        /: ----------------------------------------
        <- [counters] | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.6
            | %{ref_axes}: [counter]
            | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
            | %{ref_element}: int
            <= $% %>([%(1)]) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.6.1 | ?{sequence}: assigning
                /: ABSTRACTION: Initialize counters to list containing only 1
                | %{literal<$% counters>}: [1]
        
        /: ----------------------------------------
        /: Initialize AOC schemas records before loop
        /: ----------------------------------------
        <- [AOC schemas records] | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.7
            | %{ref_axes}: [canonical]
            | %{ref_shape}: (0,)
            | %{ref_element}: dict(id: str, trigger: dict, obligation: dict, timing: dict, abort: dict)
            <= $% %>([%([])]) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.7.1 | ?{sequence}: assigning
                /: ABSTRACTION: Initialize AOC schemas records to empty list
                | %{literal<$% aoc_schemas_records>}: []
        
        /: ----------------------------------------
        /: Iterative extraction loop
        /: ----------------------------------------
        <- [all AOC schemas] | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8
            | %{ref_axes}: [canonical]
            | %{ref_shape}: (n_canonical,)
            | %{ref_element}: dict(id: str, trigger: dict, obligation: dict, timing: dict, abort: dict)
            <= *. %>([counters]) %<({new AOC}) %:({counter}) %@(1) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1 | ?{sequence}: looping
                /: LOOP: For each counter, extract a new AOC canonical
                
                <= $. %>({new AOC}) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.1 | ?{sequence}: assigning
                    /: LOOP RETURN: Return the new AOC for this iteration
                
                <- {new AOC} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.2
                    | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                    | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
                    | %{ref_element}: dict(id: str, trigger: dict, obligation: dict, timing: dict, abort: dict)
                    <= ::(extract a new action-obligation canonical from specs) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.2.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
                        | %{norm_input}: v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Literal
                        | %{v_input_norm}: prompt_location
                        | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/prompts/phase1/extract_aoc_canonical.md
                        | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
                        | %{body_faculty}: llm
                    <- {all user inputs}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.2.2
                        | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                        | %{ref_element}: dict
                    <- [AOC schemas extracted so far]<:{2}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.2.3
                        | %{ref_axes}: [canonical]
                        | %{ref_element}: dict
                        <= &[#] %>[{AOC schema record}] %+(canonical) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.2.3.1 | ?{sequence}: grouping
                            /: GROUPING: Collect all AOC schemas from records
                        <- [AOC schemas records] | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.2.3.2
                            | %{ref_axes}: [canonical]
                            | %{ref_element}: dict
                
                <- [AOC schemas records] | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.3
                    | %{ref_axes}: [canonical]
                    | %{ref_shape}: (n_canonical,)
                    | %{ref_element}: dict(id: str, trigger: dict, obligation: dict, timing: dict, abort: dict)
                    | %{is_invariant}: true
                    <= $+ %>([AOC schemas records]) %<({new AOC}) %:(canonical) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.3.1 | ?{sequence}: assigning
                        /: CONTINUATION: Append new AOC to AOC schemas records
                    <- [AOC schemas records]<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.3.1.1
                        | %{ref_axes}: [canonical]
                        | %{ref_element}: dict
                    <- {new AOC}<:{2}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.3.1.2
                        | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                        | %{ref_element}: dict
                
                <- <no more canonicals to process> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.4
                    | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                    | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
                    | %{ref_element}: %{truth_value}
                    <= ::(judge if there are more canonicals to process)<ALL True> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.4.1 | ?{sequence}: judgement
                        | %{norm_input}: v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Boolean
                        | %{v_input_norm}: prompt_location
                        | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/prompts/phase1/judge_more_canonicals.md
                        | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
                        | %{body_faculty}: llm
                    <- {all user inputs}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.4.1.1
                        | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                        | %{ref_element}: dict
                
                /: Continue unless done: append next counter if NOT terminated
                <- [counters] | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.5
                    | %{ref_axes}: [counter]
                    | %{ref_shape}: (n_counter,)
                    | %{ref_element}: int
                    | %{is_invariant}: true
                    <= $+ %>([counters]) %<({next counter}) %:(counter) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.5.1 | ?{sequence}: assigning
                        /: CONTINUATION: Append next counter if session should NOT end
                        <= @:!(<no more canonicals to process>) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.5.1.1 | ?{sequence}: timing
                            /: TIMING GATE: Only execute if NOT done
                        <* <no more canonicals to process> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.5.1.2
                    <- [counters]<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.5.1.3
                        | %{ref_axes}: [counter]
                        | %{ref_element}: int
                    <- {next counter}<:{2}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.5.1.4
                        | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                        | %{ref_element}: int
                        <= ::(compute next counter as current counter plus one) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.5.1.4.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
                            | %{norm_input}: v_ScriptLocation-h_Literal-c_Execute-o_Literal
                            | %{v_input_norm}: script_location
                            | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/scripts/increment_counter.py
                            | %{v_function_name}: increment
                            | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
                            | %{body_faculty}: python_interpreter
                        <- {current counter}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.1.5.1.4.1.1
                            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                            | %{ref_element}: int
            
            /: Loop base and context
            <- [counters] | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.2
                | %{ref_axes}: [counter]
                | %{ref_element}: int
            <* {current counter}<$([counters])*> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.8.3
                | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                | %{ref_element}: int
                /: LOOP CONTEXT: Current counter from counters
        
        <- {all AOC schema} | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.9
            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
            | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
            | %{ref_element}: dict(rules: list, metadata: dict)
            <= ::(clean up and consolidate all AOC schemas into unified definition) | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.9.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
                | %{norm_input}: v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Literal
                | %{v_input_norm}: prompt_location
                | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/prompts/phase1/consolidate_aoc_schemas.md
                | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
                | %{body_faculty}: llm
            <- [AOC schemas records]<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.2.9.1.1
                | %{ref_axes}: [canonical]
                | %{ref_element}: dict
    
    /: ----------------------------------------
    /: Validate the generated AOC
    /: ----------------------------------------
    <- <AOC is valid> | ?{flow_index}: 1.3
        | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
        | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
        | %{ref_element}: %{truth_value}
        <= ::(judge if all AOC rules are valid)<ALL True> | ?{flow_index}: 1.3.1 | ?{sequence}: judgement
            | %{norm_input}: v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Boolean
            | %{v_input_norm}: prompt_location
            | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/prompts/phase1/validate_aoc_rules.md
            | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
            | %{body_faculty}: llm
        <- {AOC definitions}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.3.1.1
            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
            | %{ref_element}: dict

    /: ============================================================
    /: PHASE 2: Verification Against RTL Trace
    /: ============================================================
    
    /: ----------------------------------------
    /: Load and prepare trace data
    /: ----------------------------------------
    <- {RTL simulation trace} | ?{flow_index}: 1.4
        | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
        | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
        | %{ref_element}: dict(events: list, metadata: dict)
        <= ::(load RTL trace from simulation output file) | ?{flow_index}: 1.4.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
            | %{norm_input}: h_LiteralPath-c_ReadFile-o_Literal
            | %{h_input_norm}: LiteralPath
            | %{body_faculty}: file_system
        <- {trace file path}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.4.1.1
            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
            | %{ref_element}: str
            | %{literal<$% file_path>}: provisions/inputs/trace/rtl_trace.json
    
    <- [trace per cycle] | ?{flow_index}: 1.5
        | %{ref_axes}: [cycle]
        | %{ref_shape}: (n_cycle,)
        | %{ref_element}: dict(cycle_num: int, events: list)
        <= ::(split RTL trace into discrete cycles) | ?{flow_index}: 1.5.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
            | %{norm_input}: v_ScriptLocation-h_Literal-c_Execute-o_ListLiteral
            | %{v_input_norm}: script_location
            | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/scripts/split_trace_to_cycles.py
            | %{v_function_name}: split_to_cycles
            | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
            | %{body_faculty}: python_interpreter
        <- {RTL simulation trace}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.5.1.1
            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
            | %{ref_element}: dict
    
    /: ----------------------------------------
    /: The verification loop
    /: ----------------------------------------
    <- [verification per cycle] | ?{flow_index}: 1.6
        | %{ref_axes}: [cycle]
        | %{ref_shape}: (n_cycle,)
        | %{ref_element}: dict(cycle_num: int, status: str, violations: list, active_rules: list)
        <= *. %>([trace per cycle]) %<({verification}) %:({cycle trace}) %^({previous active rules}) %@(1) | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1 | ?{sequence}: looping
            /: LOOP: For each cycle trace, verify against active rules
            /: Carries active rules state between iterations
            
            <= $. %>({verification}) | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.1 | ?{sequence}: assigning
                /: LOOP RETURN: Return verification result for this iteration
                <= @:'(<AOC is valid>) | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.1.1 | ?{sequence}: timing
                    /: TIMING GATE: Only proceed if AOC is valid
                <* <AOC is valid> | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.1.2
            
            <- {active rules} | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.2
                | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
                | %{ref_element}: dict(rules: list, pending: list, triggered: list)
                <= ::(update active rules based on current cycle trace) | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.2.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
                    | %{norm_input}: v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Literal
                    | %{v_input_norm}: prompt_location
                    | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/prompts/phase2/update_active_rules.md
                    | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
                    | %{body_faculty}: llm
                <- {current cycle trace}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.2.1.1
                    | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                    | %{ref_element}: dict
                <- {previous active rules}<:{2}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.2.1.2
                    | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                    | %{ref_element}: dict
                <- {AOC definitions}<:{3}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.2.1.3
                    | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                    | %{ref_element}: dict
            
            <- {verification} | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.3
                | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                | %{ref_shape}: (1,)
                | %{ref_element}: dict(cycle_num: int, status: str, violations: list, active_rules: list)
                <= ::(verify trace against active rules for this cycle) | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.3.1 | ?{sequence}: imperative
                    | %{norm_input}: v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Literal
                    | %{v_input_norm}: prompt_location
                    | %{v_input_provision}: provisions/prompts/phase2/verify_cycle.md
                    | %{h_input_norm}: Literal
                    | %{body_faculty}: llm
                <- {current cycle trace}<:{1}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.3.1.1
                    | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                    | %{ref_element}: dict
                <- {active rules}<:{2}> | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.1.3.1.2
                    | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
                    | %{ref_element}: dict
        
        /: Loop base and context
        <- [trace per cycle] | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.2
            | %{ref_axes}: [cycle]
            | %{ref_element}: dict
        <* {current cycle trace}<$([trace per cycle])*> | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.3
            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
            | %{ref_element}: dict
            /: LOOP CONTEXT: Current cycle trace from trace per cycle
        <* {previous active rules}<$({active rules})*-1> | ?{flow_index}: 1.6.4
            | %{ref_axes}: [_none_axis]
            | %{ref_element}: dict
            | %{ref_default}: {}
            /: CARRY STATE: Previous active rules from prior iteration

/: ========================================
/: SUMMARY: RTL AOC Verification Workflow
/: ========================================
/:
/: PHASE 1 - AOC SCHEMA GENERATION:
/:   1.2.2  Load ISA spec file
/:   1.2.3  Load MA spec file
/:   1.2.4  User clarifies intent blocks
/:   1.2.5  Group all inputs together
/:   1.2.6  Initialize counters
/:   1.2.7  Initialize AOC schemas records (empty list)
/:   1.2.8  Loop: extract AOC canonicals until done
/:          - Extract new AOC
/:          - Append to AOC schemas records
/:          - Judge if more canonicals to process
/:          - Conditionally continue
/:   1.2.9  Consolidate into unified AOC definition
/:   1.3    Validate AOC rules
/:
/: PHASE 2 - RTL TRACE VERIFICATION:
/:   1.4    Load RTL simulation trace
/:   1.5    Split trace into cycles
/:   1.6    Loop over cycles:
/:          - Update active rules (carry state)
/:          - Verify cycle against active rules
/:          - Produce per-cycle verification result
/:
/: OUTPUT:
/:   {verification report} containing:
/:   - AOC definitions
/:   - AOC validity
/:   - Trace data
/:   - Per-cycle verification results
/:
/: KEY PATTERNS USED:
/:   - Self-terminating loop (continuation via $+ with @:! timing gate)
/:   - State carry between iterations (%^ modifier)
/:   - Conditional execution (timing gates)
/:   - Judgement for validation
/:   - Grouping for data collection
/:
/: PARADIGMS:
/:   - h_LiteralPath-c_ReadFile-o_Literal (file loading)
/:   - v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Literal (LLM generation)
/:   - v_PromptLocation-h_Literal-c_GenerateThinkJson-o_Boolean (LLM judgement)
/:   - v_ScriptLocation-h_Literal-c_Execute-o_Literal (Python scripts)
/:   - v_ScriptLocation-h_Literal-c_Execute-o_ListLiteral (Python list output)
/:
/: PROVISIONS REQUIRED:
/:   prompts/phase1/
/:     - decompose_specs.md
/:     - extract_aoc_canonical.md
/:     - judge_more_canonicals.md
/:     - consolidate_aoc_schemas.md
/:     - validate_aoc_rules.md
/:   prompts/phase2/
/:     - update_active_rules.md
/:     - verify_cycle.md
/:   prompts/
/:     - combine_verification_report.md
/:   scripts/
/:     - increment_counter.py
/:     - split_trace_to_cycles.py
/:   inputs/specs/
/:     - isa_v1.md
/:     - uarch_v2.md
/:   inputs/trace/
/:     - rtl_trace.json

